# Scratch files the koans create while they run. A koan that fails leaves its
# cleanup unrun (the longjmp skips it), so these can appear at any time — and
# committing one breaks a fresh clone, because koans that expect to create a
# file find it already there.
koan_*.tmp
koan_*/
*.tmp
